 | Type  | Description              |\n| ------ | ---- | -------- | ----- | ------------------------ |\n| 224    | 32   | reserved | bytes | Zero on client requests. |","table":"table-1"},"528":{"id":"/docs/binary-protocol/framing-40","page_id":"/docs/binary-protocol/framing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/binary-protocol/framing#operation-discriminants","content":"The `operation` byte tells the server which state-machine operation the request carries. Replicated operations are identified by `operation` alone. Non-replicated operations (reads, ping) all use `operation = 2` and carry their concrete u32 command code in header bytes 196..200."},"529":{"id":"/docs/binary-protocol/framing-41","page_id":"/docs/binary-protocol/framing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/binary-protocol/framing#operation-discriminants","content":"Values a client may send:"},"530":{"id":"/docs/binary-protocol/framing-42","page_id":"/docs/binary-protocol/framing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/binary-protocol/framing#operation-discriminants","content":"| Value | Operation  | Plane                                      |\n| ----- | ---------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 1     | `Register` | session (login handshake, codes 40 and 45) |","table":"table-2"},"531":{"id":"/docs/binary-protocol/framing-43","page_id":"/docs/binary-protocol/framing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/binary-protocol/framing#operation-discriminants","content":"| Value | Operation       | Plane                                             |\n| ----- | --------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| 2     | `NonReplicated` | reads and ping. The u32 code rides bytes 196..200 |","table":"table-2"},"532":{"id":"/docs/binary-protocol/framing-44","page_id":"/docs/binary-protocol/framing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/binary-protocol/framing#operation-discriminants","content":"| Value | Operation | Plane             |\n| ----- | --------- | ----------------- |